A spec declaring an empty `columns` list still projects — it is not read as "no projection" —
so the rows come back carrying `path` and `slug` and none of the frontmatter.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/config.yaml --
core:
  probe_playbook:
    queries:
      bare_plans:
        glob:
          - plans/*/index.md
        columns: []
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/alpha/index.md --
---
title: Alpha
status: ready-for-dev
---

body
-- cmd --
booping query --config core.probe_playbook.queries.bare_plans --output json
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
[
  {
    "path": "plans/alpha/index.md",
    "slug": "alpha"
  }
]
-- stderr --
